# Copy to .env.local (untracked) to fill in real values.

# Optional. When set, `npm run dev` proxies /api and /oauth2 to this URL, and
# serves its app-config with a same-origin userInfoUrl, instead of talking to nothing.
# Point this at a running csaf-cms-backend docker stack's reverse-proxy
# entry point (see csaf-cms-backend/docker/README.md), e.g.:
#CSAF_DEV_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost
